winemetal: Drive iOS GPUs and report to the app.

BC textures can be stored as ETC2/EAC (KITSUNE_BC_NATIVE), and so can large
sampled RGBA8 textures (KITSUNE_RGBA_ETC2): etcpak encodes them at upload.
Nil drawables are logged and can be injected (KITSUNE_NIL_DRAWABLE_EVERY).
It adds a GPU debug mask, honours the app's frame cap, and gives the app the
present count, GPU busy time and Metal allocation totals.
